---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Cookie Policy — Prayer Times UAE"
  description="Cookie Policy for Prayer Times UAE — how we use cookies and similar technologies on our website."
  canonical="/cookie-policy"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 text-gray-800" dir="ltr">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2" style="color: #097233;">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: April 2025</p>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3" style="color: #097233;">1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        Cookies are small text files placed on your device when you visit a website. They help the
        site remember your preferences and improve your experience on future visits.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3" style="color: #097233;">2. How We Use Cookies</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Prayer Times UAE is an informational website that displays Islamic prayer times for cities
        across the United Arab Emirates. We use a minimal set of cookies and similar browser
        technologies for the following purposes:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>
          <strong>Preferences:</strong> We store your cookie consent choice in
          <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded text-sm">localStorage</code> so we do not ask you
          again on future visits.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Analytics (optional):</strong> If analytics are enabled, we may use cookies to
          understand how visitors interact with the site (pages visited, time on site). This data
          is aggregated and anonymous.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Performance:</strong> Cookies may be used to cache prayer time data so pages load
          faster on repeat visits.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3" style="color: #097233;">3. Types of Cookies We Use</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
          <thead>
            <tr class="text-white text-left" style="background-color: #097233;">
              <th class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">Cookie / Key</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">Type</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">Purpose</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold">Duration</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-t border-gray-200 bg-white">
              <td class="px-4 py-2 font-mono">cookie_consent</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2">localStorage</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2">Stores your Accept / Decline choice</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2">Persistent (until cleared)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-t border-gray-200 bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-4 py-2 font-mono">_ga, _gid</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2">Analytics (3rd party)</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2">Google Analytics — anonymous usage data</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2">Up to 2 years</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3" style="color: #097233;">4. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        We may use third-party services such as Google Analytics to measure site traffic. These
        services may set their own cookies. We do not control these cookies. Please refer to the
        respective privacy policies of those services for more information.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3" style="color: #097233;">5. Your Choices</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed mb-3">
        You can manage or withdraw your consent at any time by:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>Using the <strong>Accept</strong> or <strong>Decline</strong> buttons on the cookie
        banner that appears on your first visit.</li>
        <li>Clearing your browser's <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded text-sm">localStorage</code>
        and cookies via your browser settings — the banner will reappear on your next visit.</li>
        <li>Configuring your browser to block all cookies. Note that some site features may not
        work correctly if cookies are disabled.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3" style="color: #097233;">6. Contact</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        If you have any questions about this Cookie Policy, please contact us via the
        <a href="/about/" class="underline" style="color: #097233;">About</a> page.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-10">
      This policy applies to the Prayer Times UAE website. It may be updated periodically —
      please check back for the latest version.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
